  82:       background cells beside the other same-colored object so their union is a
  83:       solid axis-aligned rectangle.
  84:     - Clear the left-edge object's original cells to the background.
  85:     - Paint that object at the unique completing offset, preserving all other cells.
  86:     Key insight
  87:     - The active color is identified by object structure and rectangle completion,
  88:       not by a fixed color id; the same-colored anchor object stays in place.
